<h2>Parameter Variogram</h2>
Parameter Variogram.
The following paraméters are often used to describe variograms:
<ul>
<li>nugget formula_43: The height of the jump of the semivariogram at the discontinuity at the origin.</li>
<li>sill formula_14: Limit of the variogram tending to infinity lag distances.</li>
<li>range formula_45: The distance in which the difference of the variogram from the sill gets neglectable. The exact position, where the difference gets "neglectable" is quite imprecise.</li>
