<doc id="25313" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=25313" title="Eurocode">
Eurocode

Eurocode (disebut ogé EN Eurocode atawa EC) nyaéta runtuyan &lt;a href="model%20building%20code"&gt;kode model wangunan&lt;/a&gt; pan-Eropa nu disusun ku &lt;a href="CEN"&gt;Komisi Eropa keur Standarisasi&lt;/a&gt;.
EN Eurocode disusun dina 57 bagéan, unggal bagéan dicitak misah salaku European Standard.
Dina taun 2002, sapuluh Eurocode geus disusun jeung dicitak:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="EN%201990"&gt;EN 1990&lt;/a&gt;: (Eurocode 0) Basis of &lt;a href="structural%20design"&gt;structural design&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="EN%201991"&gt;EN 1991&lt;/a&gt;: (Eurocode 1) Actions on &lt;a href="structure"&gt;structure&lt;/a&gt;s</li>
<li>&lt;a href="EN%201992"&gt;EN 1992&lt;/a&gt;: (Eurocode 2) Design of concrete structures</li>
<li>&lt;a href="EN%201993"&gt;EN 1993&lt;/a&gt;: (Eurocode 3) Design of &lt;a href="steel"&gt;steel&lt;/a&gt; structures</li>
<li>&lt;a href="EN%201994"&gt;EN 1994&lt;/a&gt;: (Eurocode 4) Design of composite steel and concrete structures</li>
<li>&lt;a href="EN%201995"&gt;EN 1995&lt;/a&gt;: (Eurocode 5) Design of &lt;a href="timber"&gt;timber&lt;/a&gt; structures</li>
