<doc id="25516" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=25516" title="MHEG-5">
MHEG-5

MHEG-5, atawa &lt;a href="International%20Organization%20for%20Standardization"&gt;ISO&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="IEC"&gt;IEC&lt;/a&gt; 13522-5, nyaéta bagéan tina hiji kumpulan standar internasional nu patali jeung midangkeun informasi, distandarkeun ku &lt;a href="Multimedia"&gt;Multimedia&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="Hypermedia"&gt;Hypermedia&lt;/a&gt; Experts Group (MHEG). Ilaharna dipaké minangka basa keur nerangkeun jasa &lt;a href="televisi%20interaktif"&gt;televisi interaktif&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Pasipatan</h2>
Pasipatan.
MHEG-5 mangrupa basa program &lt;a href="declarative%20programming"&gt;deklaratif&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="dumasar%20obj%C3%A9k"&gt;dumasar objék&lt;/a&gt; nu bisa dipaké keur ngajentrekeun pidangan teks, gambar katut vidéo. Aplikasi MHEG-5 ngawengku sajumlah Scenes nu bisa dipundah-pindah pamake aplikasina. Unggal Scene ngadaptar item teks katut grafik pikeun nu baris dipidangkeun sarta bisa ngandung blok kode &lt;a href="procedural%20programming"&gt;prosedural&lt;/a&gt; nu dijalankeun minangka respon kana salah sahiji tina sakumpulan &lt;a href="event%20driven%20programming"&gt;kajadian&lt;/a&gt; nu geus ditetepkeun tiheula kawas tombol dipencet, timer hurung atawa eusina geus hasil asup kana memori. Blok kode ieu ngawengku peta dasar (elementary actions) nu bisa nyieun operasi kawas ngarobah teks nu kapidangkeun ku hiji &lt;a href="object%20%28computer%20science%29"&gt;objek&lt;/a&gt; teks, atawa ngamimitian muter klip vidéo.
<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
MHEG-5 is suited to programming &lt;a href="interactive%20kiosk"&gt;interactive kiosk&lt;/a&gt;s and &lt;a href="interactive%20television"&gt;interactive television&lt;/a&gt; services.
<h2>Profil</h2>
Profil.
The MHEG-5 language itself is just that, a language. To be useful in any particular context, the language needs to be &lt;a href="profile%20%28engineering%29"&gt;profiled&lt;/a&gt;.
In the &lt;a href="UK"&gt;UK&lt;/a&gt; and in &lt;a href="New%20Zealand"&gt;New Zealand&lt;/a&gt;, MHEG-5 is used to provide &lt;a href="interactive%20television"&gt;interactive&lt;/a&gt; services for digital television. The full specification of how MHEG-5 is used in the context of the UK &lt;a href="Freeview"&gt;Freeview&lt;/a&gt; platform is the &lt;a href="UK%20Profile%20of%20MHEG-5"&gt;UK Profile of MHEG-5&lt;/a&gt;. A similar specification is used in New Zéaland.
In Hong Kong, &lt;a href="Television%20Broadcasts%20Limited"&gt;TVB&lt;/a&gt; has also selected MHEG-5 middleware for interactive services available on its digital broadcasting channels.
A broadcast profile of the language has also been standardized by &lt;a href="ETSI"&gt;ETSI&lt;/a&gt; forming ETSI standard ES 202 184.
