<doc id="25564" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=25564" title="Stasion Seoul">
Stasion Seoul

Stasion Séoul nyaéta stasion kareta api gedé nu perenahna di &lt;a href="Seoul"&gt;Seoul&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Korea%20Kidul"&gt;Korea Kidul&lt;/a&gt;. Stasion ieu disadiakeun ku &lt;a href="Jalur%20Gyeongbu"&gt;Jalur Gyeongbu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gyeongbu%20Line%20%28KTX%29"&gt;high-speed counterpart&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Gyeongui%20Line"&gt;Gyeongui Line&lt;/a&gt;, kalayan jasa &lt;a href="KTX"&gt;high-speed&lt;/a&gt;, express, tur lokal nu frequent ka sababaraha titik tujuan di &lt;a href="Korea%20Kidul"&gt;Korea Kidul&lt;/a&gt;.
Stasion ieu mangrupa terminal pangtungtungna keur &lt;a href="Korea%20Train%20Express"&gt;KTX&lt;/a&gt; jeung layanan express ka &lt;a href="Stasion%20Busan"&gt;Busan&lt;/a&gt; sarta layanan lokal ka &lt;a href="Stasion%20Dorasan"&gt;Dorasan&lt;/a&gt;. Stasion ieu ogé nyadiakeun losinan kareta unggal poena di &lt;a href="Jalur%20Honam"&gt;Jalur Honam&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Jalur%20Honam%20%28KTX%29"&gt;express counterpart&lt;/a&gt;na ka &lt;a href="Stasion%20Gwangju"&gt;Gwangju&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Stasion%20Mokpo%20Station"&gt;Mokpo&lt;/a&gt;. Stasion ieu dipaké minangka terminal panungtungan sakabéh kareta jarak jauh di jalur &lt;a href="Jalur%20Gyeongbu"&gt;Gyeongbu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jalur%20Honam"&gt;Honam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jalur%20Jeolla"&gt;Jeolla&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Jalur%20Janghang"&gt;Janghang&lt;/a&gt; Lines, tapi dina awal &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, tungtung kareta Jalur &lt;a href="Jalur%20Honam"&gt;Honam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jalur%20Jeolla"&gt;Jeolla&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Jalur%20Janghang"&gt;Janghang&lt;/a&gt; pindah ka &lt;a href="Stasion%20Yongsan"&gt;Yongsan&lt;/a&gt;.
Stasion ieu dibuka taun &lt;a href="1900"&gt;1900&lt;/a&gt; kalayan ngaran "Stasion Gyeongseong" sarta diganti jadi "Stasion Namdaemun" taun &lt;a href="1905"&gt;1905&lt;/a&gt;, sabab stasion ieu deukeut jeung &lt;a href="Namda%C3%A9mun"&gt;Namdaémun&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="1910"&gt;1910&lt;/a&gt;, ngaran kota &lt;a href="Seoul"&gt;Seoul&lt;/a&gt; robah ti &lt;a href="Hanseong"&gt;Hanseong&lt;/a&gt; jadi &lt;a href="Gyeongseong"&gt;Gyeongseong&lt;/a&gt; ("Keijo" dina &lt;a href="basa%20Jepang"&gt;basa Jepang&lt;/a&gt;), station ieu dibalikkeun deui jadi "Stasion Gyeongseong" taun &lt;a href="1915"&gt;1915&lt;/a&gt;.
Wangunan Stasion Keijo nu heubeul, dirancang ku Profesor &lt;a href="Tsukamoto%20Yasushi"&gt;Tsukamoto Yasushi&lt;/a&gt; ti &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Imperial%20University"&gt;Tokyo Imperial University&lt;/a&gt;, anggeusna taun &lt;a href="1925"&gt;1925&lt;/a&gt;. Wangunan nu maké bata beureum ieu nurun tina &lt;a href="Stasion%20Tokyo"&gt;wangunan Stasion Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;. Stasion ieu dingaranan "Stasion Seoul" taun &lt;a href="1947"&gt;1947&lt;/a&gt;. Stasion ieu digedéan sanggeus jaman &lt;a href="Perang%20Korea"&gt;Perang Korea&lt;/a&gt;, sarta terminal nu deukeuteunnana anggeus taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt; keur jasa kareta api anyar nu gancang, &lt;a href="KTX"&gt;KTX&lt;/a&gt;.
Stasion Séoul diladenan ogé ku &lt;a href="Seoul%20Subway%20Line%201"&gt;Seoul Subway Line 1&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Seoul%20Subway%20Line%204"&gt;Line 4&lt;/a&gt;.
